{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>在社群平台上看到喜愛的創作者或網紅貼文時，常會被背景音樂吸引。《BurnClub》是一款專為音樂愛好者設計的歌曲發現工具，能夠將 Instagram 或 TikTok 的公開個人檔案連結，直接轉換為該創作者常採用的背景音樂歌單。原價 US $0.99 的工具，現正提供限時免費下載，適合熱愛探索新音樂的廣大使用者。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-190.webp\">\n<h2>貼上連結即可匯出歌單</h2>\n<p>由 TikTok 與 Meta 前設計主管聯手打造，《BurnClub》打破了傳統演算法的限制，以人為核心進行音樂發現。使用者只需複製並貼上公開社群檔案連結，應用程式便會自動搜尋該帳號貼文中出現過的所有歌曲。在儲存前可先試聽歌曲，並一鍵匯出至 Spotify、Apple Music 或 YouTube Music 等主流音樂平台，完全無需註冊帳號即可順暢使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-102-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-103-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-104-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-105-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-106-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-233-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：BurnClub – Song Discovery</li>\n<li>應用類別：Music</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T00:38:40.352043+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":407,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T00:33:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T06:57:32.781720+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T00:37:34.877566+00:00","content_hash":"9a3e46a9e9d986368abbb87bee8e410ffc480d5bcf07dd377368cbd9cd65f8f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}